Package: ttlcd-studio
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: anatolijphp <anatolijphp@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: ttlcd (= @VERSION@), libgtk3.0-cil
Recommends: libayatana-appindicator3-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/anatolijphp/Thermaltake-TH240-V2-ULTRA-LCD
Description: TT LCD Studio window for the Thermaltake TH240 V2 Ultra (CL-W383) LCD
 GTK window over the ttlcd package: dashboard, live preview, display modes
 (image, GIF, colour, clock, off), device and settings pages, idle picture.
 Needs libgtk3.0-cil (GTK# 3 for Mono), which Debian/Ubuntu dropped from
 their archives (gone since Ubuntu 25.10; still packaged in 24.04). Where
 it isn't installable, use the ttlcd command line and systemd service
 instead (this package just won't install, ttlcd is unaffected).
